#: src/postulo/templates/server/plugins.html:519
#, python-format, draft
msgid ""
"A package registers a source under the <code>%(group)s</code> entry-point group. A plugin appears as soon as it is installed, in every part of this instance and without a restart. Entry points are all it can bring: a plugin with pages or tables of its own has to be built into the image. A source that fails to load is logged and left out, and the built-in ones keep working."
